  "html": "<p>Samford the Hermit is an <a href=\"/wiki/Category:NPC's\" title=\"Category:NPC's\">NPC</a> who is found at <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a>. He is a merchant who sells potions and <a href=\"/wiki/Waypoint_Scrolls\" title=\"Waypoint Scrolls\">waypoint scrolls</a>, and will buy any item from you that can be sold. His items usually range from level 1 to level 10.\n</p><p>Samford is also a quest giver and gives out a series of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Quests\" title=\"Category:Quests\">quests</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Samford.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Samford's Quests</span></h2>\n<p>Samford gives one quest:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Revenge\" title=\"Revenge\">Revenge</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p>Samford is the quest reward giver for the following quest:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hermit's_Hoop\" title=\"The Hermit's Hoop\">The Hermit's Hoop</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Voices\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Voices </span></h2>\n<object data=\"/thetownstons/extensions/audio_player/player.swf\" height=\"24\" id=\"audioplayer1\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" width=\"290\"><param name=\"movie\" value=\"/thetownstons/extensions/audio_player/player.swf\"/><param name=\"FlashVars\" value=\"playerID=1&amp;soundFile=/thetownstons/images/SamfordTheHermit.mp3,/thetownstons/images/SamfordTheHermit2.mp3\"/><param name=\"quality\" value=\"high\"/><param name=\"menu\" value=\"false\"/><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\"/></object>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
